{"tool_name":"rivulet","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>\"we propose a novel automatic 3D neuron reconstruction algorithm, named Rivulet, which is based on the multi-stencils fast-marching and iterative back-tracking. The proposed Rivulet algorithm is capable of tracing discontinuous areas without being interrupted by densely distributed noises.\"&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>This plugin can be used with default parameters or with user-defined parameters.</p>\n\n<p>Example image obtained from Rivulet Wiki website (<a href=\"https://github.com/RivuletStudio/Rivulet-Neuron-Tracing-Toolbox/wiki\">https://github.com/RivuletStudio/Rivulet-Neuron-Tracing-Toolbox/wiki</a>)&nbsp;</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>\"we propose a novel automatic 3D neuron reconstruction algorithm, named Rivulet, which is based on the multi-stencils fast-marching and iterative back-tracking. The proposed Rivulet algorithm is capable of tracing discontinuous areas without being interrupted by densely distributed noises.\"&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This plugin can be used with default parameters or with user-defined parameters.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Example image obtained from Rivulet Wiki website (https://github.com/RivuletStudio/Rivulet-Neuron-Tracing-Toolbox/wiki)&nbsp;</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2023-04-28T13:16:51+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2017-09-12T01:50:05+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":4221,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"6cdfadb1-03f8-4f22-95e3-3b01fe1ebf00","url":"/taxonomy/term/4221"},{"target_id":4216,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"1d6de43f-f02a-4b58-a41a-f68e7e4f0841","url":"/taxonomy/term/4216"},{"target_id":4218,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"15a64eb9-0375-4868-ad76-fe7024d32473","url":"/taxonomy/term/4218"},{"target_id":4222,"target_type":"taxonomy_ter